/-! ## 7. STAR-ID (ii) at `j = 3`, in the target vocabulary -/

/-- `Ã3` at a natural argument, in the base module's own vocabulary — the `j = 3` entry of
the operator `StarForallCandt1.star_forall` is stated with. -/
